### User Managment ###

1. To add a User
:/# useradd <User Name>

2. To add password for the user
:/# passwd <User Name>

3. To check the user details 
:/# vim /etc/passwd/                                <This will show the user file can use cat>

4. To check the user password
:/# vim /etc/shadow/                                <This will show the encrypted password for user>

5. To delete the user
:/# userdel <User Name>

# NOTE: If the user forgots the password no one can recover it the password encryption is on way can't be decrypt